{"ID":"20240118151209-w7jcmti","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151209-w7jcmti","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151209-w7jcmti\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151209-27q400p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122115104-zmuor0f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122115104-zmuor0f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:203,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:203\u0026#125;","title":"142苦菜","type":"doc","updated":"20240130164620"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151209-27q400p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151209-27q400p","updated":"20240122115041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主五脏邪气，厌谷胃痹，久服安心益气，聪察少卧，轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115044-1q655pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115044-1q655pa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，凌冬不死，诗云谁谓荼苦，即此物也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115046-bxead03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115046-bxead03"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115047-hrv3pxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115047-hrv3pxh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】苦菜主明目，除热，治痈疮，黄疸，调经脉，去邪气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115049-yijqbed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115049-yijqbed"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】肠澼，渴热中疾，恶疮，久服耐饥寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115050-haslogd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115050-haslogd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【嘉佑】调十二经脉，霍乱后胃气烦逆，久服强力，虽冷甚益人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115052-o74um31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115052-o74um31"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【臓器】捣汁饮除面目皮及舌下黄，其白汁涂疔肿拔根，滴痈上利溃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115054-h27dk3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115054-h27dk3k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【纲目】主明目诸痢血淋痔瘘。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115055-pp4poko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115055-pp4poko"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115056-e9aiv6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115056-e9aiv6x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】脾胃虚寒人不可食，不可共蜜食。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115057-hm4yt35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115057-hm4yt35"}},{"ID":"20240122115057-nzqktzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115057-nzqktzn"}},{"ID":"20240122115057-g9i44ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115057-g9i44ex","updated":"20240130164527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第142，诸位看，啊老师上经不是一百二十味，现在一百四十二味了还没讲完，最后一个就是苦菜。苦菜这个药呢，它是味苦寒是味苦的药，能够坚能够泻，性寒，这种药平常都可以当食物来吃。苦菜主明目，能够...诸位看这就是白瓜子，冬瓜籽，冬瓜仁，不是你吃的外面买的白瓜子，你不要买那个来吃，那个不好的。要吃这个冬瓜籽。"}]},{"ID":"20240122115104-zmuor0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115104-zmuor0f","updated":"20240130164620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般来说，苦味能坚，能泻，所以说，如果说因为它苦味大部分都是性寒，寒凉的药。如果你是热性的下利，热性的下利都可以使用啊，寒凉的药。那眼睛明目都可以使用，使用的地方呢，你看这个【臓器】里面就讲了，捣汁成那个饮，涂在眼睛上面，这个可以治眼睛的病，可以治疗，也可以敷面，眼科都可以使用。那我们很多药水可以做成药水点在眼睛里面，点在眼睛里面都没有关系，那这也是我们常常使用的一种。那处处有之，我们讲的这个苦菜。"}]}]}